        <h1>Convert a Bank Statement to Excel, <em>Nothing Uploaded</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain guide to turning a PDF bank statement into clean Excel or CSV in your browser: how to do it, why in-browser processing is the safe way, how it compares to paid converters, and how to reach the older history your bank keeps locked in PDF.</p>
